  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "做伙來唸詩 - 鐘聲ê祝福"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "\n<div class=\"tg-article\" style=\"font-family: 'Microsoft JhengHei', sans-serif; max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; line-height: 1.8; color: #333;\">\n    <h1 style=\"color: #000; font-size: 36px; text-align: center; margin-bottom: 5px; font-weight: bold;\">鐘聲ê祝福</h1>\n    \n    \n    \n    <div style=\"text-align: center; margin-bottom: 30px;\">\n        <p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 20px; margin: 0;\">/ 李淑貞</p>\n        \n    </div>\n    \n    <div class=\"tg-images\">\n        <div style=\"text-align: center; margin-bottom: 20px;\"><img src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEi44zszlfcoz78YaopgRDX5l1nlhF9xQcPr-tDKkfwr9EKmrFTAHx49FJBZ-aHxfTgaQtzyHEwQPdq970LUe9Bu05Fyi1jYHHNK5A0C_tvzV3M15fLZjSz_BrCZzBF7cYQdMvGjhZ-i_0X6B_fGbMJB50kftyS_aFLNnWHrPS8FTghtDAeQAHY1siD1Unbt\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 4px;\"></div>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div class=\"tg-content\" style=\"font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.5px; margin-bottom: 30px; text-align: justify; padding: 0 10px;\">\n        年beh到　歡樂滿sì-kè<br>家家戶戶辦年貨<br>囡仔目睭nih-nih看　等硩年錢<br>出外人無閒規年<br>冗早tńg--來<br>赴二九暝圍爐<br><br>一家tsiâu到團圓<br>圓桌坐圓圓　桌跤烘爐燒hōng-hōng<br>財運興旺好運來<br>吉祥年菜排滿滿<br>Tshuân<br>雞　代代囝孫好起家<br>魚　年年有餘<br>魚丸、肉丸　中狀元<br>豆乾　做大官<br>發粿　菜頭粿<br>年年高升　大富大貴<br>甜粿　甜甜好過年<br>甜圓　一家和樂平安團圓<br>長年菜　長命百歲<br>烏魚子　濟囝koh濟孫<br>生仁糖、冬瓜糖、寸棗<br>麻粩、桔紅　甜甜趁大錢<br><br>二九暝後<br>望<br>馬年若到　順風順勢<br>四季tsiâu-tsiâu<br>萬萬順<br>雙手紅包跪拜長輩<br>祝長命百歲<br>長輩hōo下輩紅包<br>祝財運連連<br>囡仔硩年錢<br>平安健康大漢<br>吉祥春聯日日好運<br>108鐘聲祝福<br>健康、平安、幸福、光明、希望\n    </div>\n\n    \n\n    <div class=\"donation-section\" style=\"background-color: #fcfcfc; border: 1px solid #eeeeee; border-radius: 10px; overflow: hidden; margin-top: 40px;\">\n        <div style=\"width: 100%;\"><img src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEi20in9xKw5BPByKODlpT40QttBQBpGqfKWj9_sAQh9oLVfy-jRtdc_JH09t9MiB8fLolDJbfO4s2GGYZWYNpktdrEIh2nLycKd6wydIsY1gBBDL2gvXNMPD1AgiKXOSNieKNCQ4hplEOAPuXI6e1m2dNMlVF_hNo54FUehi5sDslJppypqW0Up8oJJqfkx\" style=\"width: 100%; display: block;\"></div>\n        <div style=\"padding: 30px; text-align: center; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\">\n            <div style=\"margin-bottom: 15px; font-size: 22px;\">\n                <b><span style=\"color: #3778cd;\">#台文通訊BONG報</span> 383期，2026年02月出刊。</b>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"color: #274e13; font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 10px;\">歡迎捐款贊助　#李江却台語文教基金會</div>\n            <div style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: 16px;\">\n                線上捐款(定期定額) <a href=\"https://donate.newebpay.com/Period/akhioh/lkk\" style=\"color: #3778cd; text-decoration: none;\" target=\"_blank\">點此連結</a><br>\n                線上捐款(單筆) <a href=\"https://donate.newebpay.com/akhioh/lkk\" style=\"color: #3778cd; text-decoration: none;\" target=\"_blank\">點此連結</a>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"color: #274e13; font-size: 15px; margin-top: 15px; line-height: 1.5;\">\n                郵政劃撥：19021486 / 戶名：財團法人李江却台語文教基金會<br>\n                電匯：123-20-050514-2 (華南銀行士林分行)\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"color: #050505; font-size: 15px; margin-top: 25px; padding-top: 15px; border-top: 1px solid #eee; text-align: justify;\">\n                #李江却台語文教基金會 需要你ê定期捐款，逐年贊助本會（台文通訊BONG報發行單位）NT$2,400，lán做伙復振台灣語文ê事工kap雜誌編印發行費用，捐款thang抵稅。\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</div>"
  },
